{"type":"before","callId":"pw:api@526","stepId":"pw:api@526","startTime":577906.027,"class":"Test","method":"pw:api","title":"Fill \"When I think about mobile games or battle royale games, several brands and titles immediately come to mind. One of the most prominent ones is Fortnite, which has been a cultural phenomenon for years. I've spent countless hours playing Fortnite with friends and family, and its engaging gameplay, colorful graphics, and regular updates have kept me hooked. Another title that comes to mind is PUBG Mobile, which offers a more realistic and intense battle royale experience. I've also been a fan of Call of Duty: Mobile, which brings the popular console franchise to the mobile platform with impressive graphics and fast-paced gameplay. Additionally, I've enjoyed playing Garena Free Fire, which offers a more casual and accessible battle royale experience. I've also dabbled in other titles like Apex Legends Mobile and Rules of Survival, but these four brands have been my go-to choices for mobile gaming. I appreciate the variety of game modes, customization options, and social features that these games offer, which have helped to keep me engaged and entertained for hours on end.\" locator('div.min-w-full.shrink-0').first().locator('input:not([type=\"radio\"]):not([type=\"checkbox\"]):not([type=\"hidden\"]):not([type=\"button\"]):not([type=\"submit\"]):not([type=\"range\"]):not([type=\"file\"]), textarea, [role=\"textbox\"]').first()","params":{"selector":"div.min-w-full.shrink-0 >> nth=0 >> input:not([type=\"radio\"]):not([type=\"checkbox\"]):not([type=\"hidden\"]):not([type=\"button\"]):not([type=\"submit\"]):not([type=\"range\"]):not([type=\"file\"]), textarea, [role=\"textbox\"] >> nth=0","value":"When I think about mobile games or battle royale games, several brands and titles immediately come to mind. One of the most prominent ones is Fortnite, which has been a cultural phenomenon for years. I've spent countless hours playing Fortnite with fr